; wf_link_share_difficulty: wheelfir main. Shares the DIFFICULTY LEVEL between two linked cabinets,
;   then rebuilds the EEPROM settings block and resets. The second cabinet (wf_link_player_number
;   nonzero) receives a byte over the link and stores it into wf_difficulty; the first sends its own
wf_link_share_difficulty:
