; wf_note_period_table: wheelfir main. Note -> period table, 36 words for notes 1..36, read from the
;   base 0xdac2c indexed by the note, so index 0 is the `rts` that closes the routine before it. It
;   IS ProTracker's period table with finetune 0: 856, 808, 762, ... 120, 113
