000dc498  6100e29a              bsr.w wf_snd_tick

; wf_snd_enqueue_block: wheelfir main. Stamps 0xA0A0 plus the block's 96 bytes into the raster's
;   per-line table (0x590(a6) = the line 200 slot of the array starting at 0x400(a6)) and CLEARS the
;   source buffer so that whatever was not rewritten travels as zero
