; wf_scroll_vblank: Writes word 8's low byte from D0, which it also stores to 0x201cbe, inside the
;   vblank handler (IRQ3, 0xdc340..0xdc59e), once per frame. MEASURED with a per-site write log over
;   an attract cycle: 2982 writes at vpos 247..262, the page bit set in 1430
