; wf_page_of_frame: Sets the frame's page by writing the blitter's word 8. It is the ONLY one of
;   that word's four writers that falls on vpos 0..0, once per frame, and it alternates 951/907 over
;   an attract cycle. MEASURED with `WFV2_SITIOS` (switch WITHDRAWN)=1, which records the writes by
;   PC, whether they carried bit 0x20 and which beam line they fell on: that is what finally
;   separates the four physically, because the access mask does not tell them apart (all four write
;   the low byte)
wf_page_of_frame:
000dc61a  13f900201cbe00700011  move.b (DAT_00201cbe).l,(DAT_00700011).l  ; scale_and_scroll

