; wf_sprite_case0: The dispatcher's fifth case: tst.w 0x16(a1) and, if the register's mode is ZERO,
;   it goes to 0xe5292..0xe52f0, which writes parameters, arms and fires WITHOUT touching any mode
;   register. It is the NORMAL case: 117740 of 117742 blits in 90 s emulated
wf_sprite_case0:
000e528a  4a690016              tst.w (0x16,A1)
000e528e  6600006e              bne.w LAB_000e52fe
000e5292  33d100700000          move.w (A1),(blit_data).l  ; src_u_and_dst_x
000e5298  33e9000400700004      move.w (0x4,A1),(DAT_00700004).l  ; src_v_and_dst_y
000e52a0  33e900080070000c      move.w (0x8,A1),(DAT_0070000c).l  ; page_and_direct_port

; wf_sprite_reg7: move.w 0xa(a1),0x70000e: copies the sprite register's flags field into the
;   blitter's word 7. Bits 2 and 3 come down through here, the field that separates drawing from
;   erasing
