000e52e8  33e9000e00700012      move.w (0xe,A1),(DAT_00700012).l  ; high_bits_and_small_scale

; wf_fire_case0: The FIRING of the dispatcher's case 0 (0x70001e=0xffff). Almost everything the game
;   draws comes out through it, sprites and backgrounds alike: 117740 of 117742 blits in 90 s
;   emulated, because case 0 is the normal one and touches no mode register. It is the CONTROL
;   address of the traces, with 52527 firings measured in 50 s
