; wf_engine_pitch: wheelfir main. Sets voice 5 (register 0x20cde8: read opcode at +12, step at +14)
;   from the field at 0x20692e+0x38: a playback rate in Hz, scaled from that field, plus 16000 or
;   6000 by the field at +0x3c, capped at 24000, then raised by 6000 more while the flag at +0x20 is
;   set, so up to 30000. Above 15625, the mixer's modulus (snd_v1_step), it writes the rate minus
;   15625 as the step and the post-increment read opcode (0x101d instead of 0x1015), so the voice
;   takes one sample per interrupt plus the phase-accumulated remainder: the octave trick of
;   snd_v1_opcode. Named for the engine by its use in the race, not by anything the game prints
wf_engine_pitch:
